<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The energy bar (uiscript/energybar.py, uitaskbar.py EnergyBar): the
	     energy crystal's state, full, hungry (under 15% of its two hours
	     left) or empty, with the energy points as a hint. While the
	     energy-bar flag is on, the Interface makes the facade
	     nui_energy_bar.EnergyBar (controller assets/root/nui_energy_bar.py).
	     The state follows the status refreshes and, as legacy, a hover: the
	     hint host calls energy_over() once as the pointer enters it, where
	     legacy checked the hover every frame. The classic art is in the
	     metin2_patch_eu4 group (d:/ymir work/ui/pattern/energygauge/), a
	     root for lint and snapshots. -->
	<title>energy-bar</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="energy-bar.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" class="nui-overlay energy-bar" data-model="energy_bar">
	<div id="energy-bar" class="energy-bar__base">
		<div id="energy-gauge" class="energy-bar__gauge" data-class-is-full="state == 'full'"
			data-class-is-hungry="state == 'hungry'" data-class-is-empty="state == 'empty'"></div>
	</div>
	<span id="energy-tip" class="nui-has-tooltip energy-bar__tip" data-event-mouseover="energy_over()"><span class="nui-tooltip nui-anim energy-bar__hint">{{ tip }}</span></span>
</body>
</rml>
